NameRigel: G2$="RIGEL" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NameProcyon: G2$="PROCYON" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NameVega: G2$="VEGA" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NameCanopus: G2$="CANOPUS" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NameAltair: G2$="ALTAIR" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NameSagittarius: G2$="SAGITTARIUS" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NamePollux: G2$="POLLUX" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
