NameSirius: G2$="SIRIUS" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NameDeneb: G2$="DENEB" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NameCapella: G2$="CAPELLA" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NameBetelgeuse: G2$="BETELGEUSE" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NameAldebaran: G2$="ALDEBARAN" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NameRegulus: G2$="REGULUS" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
NameArcturus: G2$="ARCTURUS" : GOTO QuadrantSuffix
